  "Presets stay in shared/presets/user/image across app updates.": "更新后预设仍保存在shared/presets/user/image。",
  "Recent results, directly in this studio.": "直接在工作室查看最近结果。",
  "First input is primary; extra inputs become references.": "第一项是主要输入，其余作为参考。",
  "Generate, upload an image, or select one from Library.": "生成、上传图像或从库中选择。",
  "Face Swap preserves the target size and changes detected faces only.": "换脸保持目标尺寸，只改变检测到的人脸。",
  "Face Swap uses the first reference for the largest target face; it does not regenerate the whole image.": "换脸使用第一张参考替换目标中最大的人脸，不重新生成整张图像。",
  "No pose reference: the primary face provides landmarks.": "没有姿态参考时，使用主要人脸的关键点。",
  "Lower denoise preserves more; higher denoise allows larger changes.": "较低降噪保留更多内容，较高降噪允许更大改变。",
  "Img2Img starts from the base image; denoise controls how much can change.": "Img2Img从基础图像开始，降噪控制改变程度。",
  "Optional refinement uses SDXL after the swap. Keep denoise low to preserve identity.": "可选优化在换脸后使用SDXL。保持较低降噪以保留身份。",
  "This checkpoint is used by InstantID and optional swap refinement. Changing it reloads the pipeline.": "此检查点用于InstantID和可选换脸优化；更改后将重新加载管线。",
  "Up to four SDXL LoRAs; used by InstantID or optional Face Swap refinement.": "最多四个SDXL LoRA，用于InstantID或可选换脸优化。",
  "One GPU job at a time. You can keep adding prompts.": "GPU一次处理一个任务，可继续添加提示词。",
  "Painted areas are replaced. Invert also reverses brush and eraser roles.": "涂绘区域将被替换，反转也会交换画笔和橡皮的作用。",
